  "_note": "Rooms, exits, ladders, vents and the task table were checked on 2026-10-22 against among-us.fandom.com (The_Airship and the per-location pages Brig, Vault, Gap_Room, Main_Hall, Engine_Room, Showers, Records, Lounge, Cargo_Bay, Ventilation, Medical, Electrical, Security_(location), Hall_of_Portraits, Kitchen, Viewing_Deck, Armory, Cockpit, Communications, Meeting_Room, Outside; Vent_(object); Tasks list table; Visual_tasks) and cross-checked with PC Gamer / Pro Game Guides (12 vents, 4 systems, no visual tasks). NO VISUAL TASKS on The Airship. MODELLING CHOICES: the hallway joining Cockpit, Communications, Armory and Engine Room is folded into direct edges between them; the two balconies are separate rooms (Outside by Viewing Deck, Outside by Security) because they are not connected to each other - the in-game label for both is just \"Outside\"; Gap Room is the LEFT (Brig / ladder) side and its edge to Records includes the moving-platform crossing (~6 s wait + ride, rough). Electrical is a maze of randomly opened doors, so its edges are averages. Ladders add ~2 s. Players choose their spawn room after every meeting (Main Hall, Brig, Engine Room, Kitchen, Records, Cargo Bay + others), so round-start positions are not shared. Travel seconds are eyeballed at speed 1.0x and unverified. Keys: c Cockpit, q Communications, a Armory, d Viewing Deck, x Outside (Viewing Deck), i Kitchen, p Hall of Portraits, s Security, o Outside (Security), e Electrical, m Medical, y Cargo Bay, f Ventilation (fans), l Lounge, r Records, w Showers, h Main Hall, g Engine Room, b Brig, u Vault, j Gap Room, t Meeting Room.",
